  "releaseNotes": "The events of the Continuous Access Evaluation Profile as typed payloads with their registered event type identifiers, so a transmitter emits and a receiver handles a session revocation or a credential change without hand-writing claim names. Registered over the Security Events core in one call; the same models serve a Shared Signals transmitter and receiver. Nothing in this package changes in 3.1.1; it ships with the 3.1.1 line. Full details: https://github.com/Abblix/Oidc.Server/releases/tag/v3.1.1",
